        m.put("On Google TV sets, Wi-Fi networks saved during initial setup belong to com.google.android.tungsten.setupwraith. Disabling setupwraith so the stock Google TV launcher stays dead will delete a Wi-Fi network owned by setupwraith.\n\nBefore disabling setupwraith:\n1. Open Wi-Fi Settings \u2192 select your Wi-Fi network \u2192 Forget network.\n2. Re-connect to your Wi-Fi network (it will now belong to com.android.tv.settings).\n3. Return here and tap \"I Forgot & Re-added Wi-Fi \u2014 Continue\".", "Tr\u00ean Google TV, m\u1ea1ng Wi-Fi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u khi thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp ban \u0111\u1ea7u thu\u1ed9c v\u1ec1 com.google.android.tungsten.setupwraith. V\u00f4 hi\u1ec7u h\u00f3a setupwraith \u0111\u1ec3 launcher Google TV g\u1ed1c kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea1y l\u1ea1i s\u1ebd x\u00f3a m\u1ea1ng Wi-Fi do setupwraith qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd.\n\nTr\u01b0\u1edbc khi v\u00f4 hi\u1ec7u h\u00f3a setupwraith:\n1. M\u1edf C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t Wi-Fi \u2192 ch\u1ecdn m\u1ea1ng Wi-Fi c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u2192 Qu\u00ean m\u1ea1ng.\n2. K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i l\u1ea1i m\u1ea1ng Wi-Fi (l\u00fac n\u00e0y m\u1ea1ng s\u1ebd thu\u1ed9c v\u1ec1 com.android.tv.settings).\n3. Quay l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n \"T\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 qu\u00ean & th\u00eam l\u1ea1i Wi-Fi \u2014 Ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c\".");
        m.put("On Google TV, if you disable setupwraith, make sure your Wi-Fi network was re-added in Wi-Fi Settings.", "Tr\u00ean Google TV, n\u1ebfu v\u00f4 hi\u1ec7u h\u00f3a setupwraith, h\u00e3y b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 th\u00eam l\u1ea1i m\u1ea1ng Wi-Fi trong C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t Wi-Fi.");
        m.put("On TCL and Philips Android 11/12 TVs, the OEM firmware often hides the Android Default Home UI and forces the stock launcher when pressing Home. Disabling the stock launcher (Option 2) or enabling the Home Button Fix (Option 3) guarantees pressing Home always opens tvOS Launcher.", "Tr\u00ean TV TCL v\u00e0 Philips ch\u1ea1y Android 11/12, firmware OEM th\u01b0\u1eddng \u1ea9n giao di\u1ec7n ch\u1ecdn launcher m\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a Android v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c m\u1edf launcher g\u1ed1c khi nh\u1ea5n Home. V\u00f4 hi\u1ec7u h\u00f3a launcher g\u1ed1c (L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn 2) ho\u1eb7c b\u1eadt s\u1eeda l\u1ed7i n\u00fat Home (L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn 3) b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea3m nh\u1ea5n Home lu\u00f4n m\u1edf tvOS Launcher.");
        m.put("On TCL, Philips, and Google TVs, OEM firmware often forces the stock launcher when pressing Home. Follow the steps below so pressing Home always opens tvOS Launcher, then click Continue.", "Tr\u00ean TV TCL, Philips v\u00e0 Google TV, firmware OEM th\u01b0\u1eddng bu\u1ed9c m\u1edf launcher g\u1ed1c khi nh\u1ea5n Home. L\u00e0m theo c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1ea5n Home lu\u00f4n m\u1edf tvOS Launcher, r\u1ed3i nh\u1ea5n Ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c.");
        m.put("On the Lock Screen, only Clock, Date, and Greeting are shown above your selected backgrounds. Pressing any remote button returns to where you were before.", "M\u00e0n h\u00ecnh kh\u00f3a ch\u1ec9 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ed3, ng\u00e0y v\u00e0 l\u1eddi ch\u00e0o tr\u00ean c\u00e1c h\u00ecnh n\u1ec1n b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ecdn. Nh\u1ea5n b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 n\u00fat n\u00e0o tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ec3 quay l\u1ea1i m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00f3.");
