        m.put("\u26a0\ufe0f Security Warning:\n\nKeep Alive monitors and restores permissions if your TV turns them off in the background.\n\nWithout WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS, Keep Alive requires Network Debugging (ADB on port 5555) to stay enabled on your home network. For better security, run Pair / Repair ADB in Secure Mode first so WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS is granted and port 5555 can be closed.\n\nEnable Keep Alive anyway?", "\u26a0\ufe0f C\u1ea3nh b\u00e1o b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt:\n\nDuy tr\u00ec ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 kh\u00f4i ph\u1ee5c c\u00e1c quy\u1ec1n n\u1ebfu TV t\u1eaft ch\u00fang \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 n\u1ec1n.\n\nN\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS, Duy tr\u00ec ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng y\u00eau c\u1ea7u G\u1ee1 l\u1ed7i qua m\u1ea1ng (ADB tr\u00ean c\u1ed5ng 5555) lu\u00f4n b\u1eadt tr\u00ean m\u1ea1ng gia \u0111\u00ecnh. \u0110\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt h\u01a1n, tr\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u00ean h\u00e3y ch\u1ea1y Gh\u00e9p n\u1ed1i / S\u1eeda ch\u1eefa ADB trong Ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 an to\u00e0n \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1ea5p WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS v\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u00f3ng c\u1ed5ng 5555.\n\nV\u1eabn b\u1eadt Duy tr\u00ec ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng?");
        m.put("\u26a0\ufe0f Your Wi-Fi network is currently owned by setupwraith. Before disabling setupwraith, open Wi-Fi Settings, Forget your Wi-Fi network, and re-connect so Wi-Fi stays saved.", "\u26a0\ufe0f M\u1ea1ng Wi-Fi c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n hi\u1ec7n do setupwraith s\u1edf h\u1eefu. Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi v\u00f4 hi\u1ec7u h\u00f3a setupwraith, h\u00e3y m\u1edf C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t Wi-Fi, ch\u1ecdn Qu\u00ean m\u1ea1ng Wi-Fi r\u1ed3i k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ea1ng Wi-Fi v\u1eabn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u.");
